  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the Election Experat Mission (EEM) to Timor-Leste 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Union intends to send an Electoral Expert Mission (EEM) to Timor-Leste to collect factual information concerning the electoral process (Parliamentary Elections - 21 May). IOM will select 2 Experts (1 Team Leader/Political/Electoral expert and 1 Legal/Human Rights Expert), who will travel to Dili from mid-April to June 2023, to meet all relevant stakeholders and produce a report. IOM will have no visibility and will not be associated in any way to the work of the experts; we will provide administrative, logistical and security support.</narrative>
  </description>
